From 8ab021eac50c5f20b39a82a6b937e7d0b3326ba2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agnya <manthram@Pradass-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 22:16:47 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Real HiBowan logo mark + Home/landing page redesign

Logo:
- Replace the old CeylonX "X" letterform PNG with the real pin+hi vector
  mark (attached_assets/hibowan-pin-hi-mark.svg), swapping the import path
  in the 8 files that reference it rather than editing each usage site.
  Inlined as a data URI by Vite (under the 4kb threshold), no separate
  asset request.

Home/landing page (client/src/pages/landing.tsx):
- Hero: added the "Explore Together." kicker, replaced the generic
  headline with "Find fellow travellers heading your way.", swapped the
  "100% Free to Use - No Hidden Fees" badge for the actual trust line
  ("No bookings. No commissions. You arrange everything directly."), and
  updated the subhead to describe the real organizer-request flow instead
  of "find rides, buddies, and unique experiences."
- How It Works: replaced the generic Sign Up / Post-Find / Travel Together
  steps with the real trust model -- post or browse, organizer accepts,
  chat unlocks -- since the organizer-gated request flow is the core
  safety mechanic or the redesign concept, not just a bullet point.
- Added a "Where people are going first" section with the three launch
  route clusters (Colombo-Galle-Ella, Ella-Arugam Bay, Yala-Udawalawe),
  which didn't exist anywhere on the real site before.

Not included in this pass: Browse Trips, Trip Detail, Calendar, and
Tribes still have their pre-redesign layouts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
